\'93}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
You, human. How do you know what I am?\'94 The imp asked, its tone wary.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Its voice was shrill, but also had a gruff quality. I had a feeling it was much older than its height made it appear. It wore a loin cloth to cover itself, but was otherwise unclothed.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Is it male?}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
 }{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
If it's a female, why isn't its top half covered up?}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
 }{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
On the other hand, I don\'92t know a thing about its cultural origins, maybe they don't gender things here like they do at home. It doesn't appear to have any breast tissue though... }{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Shaking my head to free it from wandering down a tangential thought path yet again, I told myself to quit worrying about the imp's gender and presumed it was male.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Keeping a close eye on him, I was able to anticipate what happened next when his arm twitched. He raised the pitchfork and brandished it at Marie. I wondered if he was preparing to attack us or was generally peaceful and only used the weapon to defend himself. I hoped to hell that it was the latter, even though I doubted we stood a chance with only my pocket knife.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Gods, I should have definitely packed my handgun... Then again, I seem to have telekinesis now. Maybe I could use that to subdue him?}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
 I was shrewdly brought out of my thoughts as the imp spoke again.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch
\'93}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Speak, human. I do not have time to dilly-dally. It is well past midday and I do not want to be out here after dusk. The king will have my head or skin my hide if I am besieged and taken hostage by that gang of Reds again.\'94 The imp continued staring Marie down as he shuddered at a memory of something.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
An attack? What the hell is a Red?}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Marie cleared her throat so her voice was steady and bereft of the anxious excited jitters I could tell she harboured. \'93I read about Imps in a book a couple of months ago. My mythology teacher, Mr. Riggs, only briefly mentioned your kind, but I went ahead and delved deeper into them at the campus library.\'94 She tried again to stand up, but I squeezed her shoulder.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch
\'93}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Don\'92t. We don't know a thing about his intentions towards us.\'94 I told her.}{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch\loch
 }{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
My eyes bored daggers at her again.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch
\'93}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Yeah, Marie! For once in your life, stop being so fucking impulsive and listen to Zoey.\'94 Toni said bitterly. Standing up and stepping around the log, she finally sat down on the log with Marie and I. When she turned her head to give Marie a look of admonishment, our gazes met for a brief second. She quickly broke eye contact and turned her head back towards the imp, likely trying to discern its intentions just as I was.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
Returning my eyes towards the imp, I sized it up. My curiosity was growing, but I knew I had to remain calm, and keep my voice down. }{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
If I raise my voice, he\'92ll attack us for sure!}{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch\loch
 }{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
There's no telling what might happen if the imp sees fit to view us as threats.}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
 I took a deep breath before I opened my mouth to speak.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch
\'93}{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
I\'92m sorry. Marie can be quite the handful sometimes. We seem to be lost and I cannot find my way back to our camp.\'94 I said.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\rtlch \ltrch
