\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri140\lin0\rin140\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
The ones who didn't move or immediately teleport away continued to stare me down, their faces painted with a mix of interested and intrigued expressions. They seemed to be trying to figure out why I was there. It was grossly apparent to me that they had no idea who I was. None of them breathed. Their stares bore into me and I desperately wished that I could wink myself back upstairs or out to the stables, like the other elves had done, just a moment earlier. It was so silent, you could have heard a pin hit the ground.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri140\lin0\rin140\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
