Given all that Pentor has just laid out, I don't think that's a very good idea, Toni.\'94 I shot her the most admonishing glare I could muster. Her only response was to snidely frown, so I looked to Marie for further guidance. Her hands were folded in her lap and she was chewing her bottom lip, lost in thought while she waited patiently for Pentor to explain his grievance with Toni to me.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f6
