Fortunately, I was glad she had told me the goblin's name so I could address him properly. Unfortunately, the motion I had just preformed gave Grubby the perfect opportunity to run his small, spindly digits under my armpits. }{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
