\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af8\dbch\af8\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
By this point, he had only scratched the surface of the well that was his potential for scrutiny. To my undisciplined ears, his comments merely hinted to the fact that his rhetoric was patently vitriolic. I had no problem with what he had said as his remarks hadn't wounded my ego all that much yet. At the time, I senselessly thought that I had endured harsher verbal arrogance from the pretentious teenage girls back in high school, and that things couldn't get much worse. Therefore, instead of responding with a rejoinder of my own about how Meran hadn't mentioned anything to me about what I was wearing, I chose to grit my teeth and bear the brunt of his words head on. In that moment, I was feeling pretty confident that I could tolerate whatever ridicule and moral aspersions he was getting ready to dispense.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\i\hich\af8\dbch\af8\ai\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f6
