\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
While I've been spending the last week at her side, Marie has posted herself up in the library, scouring through book after book, poring across half a dozen dusty tomes and old grimoires, their binding nearly rotted away, for hours, turning pages until her fingers nearly bleed.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
Seated in an aging reading chair whose stitching is on the verge of collapse and hunched over an old oak desk, she stares at them for hours. When her eyes start to dry out, she gets up, splashes some water on her face and jumps right back in to the fray, searching for anything that looks like it might pull Toni out of an all-consuming black pit that she's been stuck at the bottom of for nearly 7 days.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
That empty void is all I ever see whenever I manage to slip into Toni's mind.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
Even though it's been getting progressively easier for me to dive into people's psyches these past months, for the last week my dives have revealed the reason I've become so withdrawn and glum.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
In the corner a small cavern-like maw of green light is the only sign that she's not completely gone, but it's fading fast.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
I have a nagging, niggling fear that if we don't pull her out soon, I will have to resort to doing something drastic to pull her back into the light.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\ltrpar\nowidctlpar\cf0\kerning0\hich\af2\langfe2052\dbch\af2\afs24\lang1081\loch\f3\fs22\lang4105\sl100\slmult0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi720{\cf1\hich\af14\dbch\af14\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch\f8
Something I've been trying my damnedest to avoid for the last century.}
